WEBVTT

00:00:02.359 --> 00:00:07.379
Yeah, I decided to, uh, give the Whim
subscription thing a try just because

00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:13.040
I wanted a nice projector for our movie
room but didn't wanna spend the price

00:00:13.699 --> 00:00:17.179
that most of the really nice
projectors were gonna cost me.

00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:19.140
And it's been super

00:00:20.099 --> 00:00:24.950
high quality, easy to set
up, and my kids love it.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.559
We use it probably every day,

00:00:27.339 --> 00:00:31.699
and it's just been a really nice way
of having a really nice picture,

00:00:31.819 --> 00:00:32.859
movie-like,

00:00:33.719 --> 00:00:39.239
and not having to come up with three or
four thousand dollars up front to get

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.739
the movie-like experience.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.819
So yeah, it's been a
good experience so far.

00:00:44.039 --> 00:00:45.999
Everyone's been super helpful, and, uh,

00:00:46.559 --> 00:00:47.509
I'm glad we did it.
